                        <p>Upton is probably the brother-in-law of <persName key="COO08">Joanna Cooper</persName>. She married <persName key="COO01">Thomas Cooper</persName> in 1799 
    after her husband - also Captain Upcot - died. Joanna travelled from America to England with her infant so it may be that she asked her husband's brother to accompany them 
